{{Debuffnotes
| name = Toss
| desc = Cannot Toss [[debuff immune]] enemy units in front of Tiny.<br><br>However, debuff immune enemy units can be {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted to Toss a non-debuff immune unit toward them.
}}
{{Splduplicatenotes
| name = Toss
| desc = The ability is cast a second time when the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy lands.<br><br>Does nothing if there are no valid targets.
}}

 * {{Symbol|a|sub}}
** Replaces {{A|Tiny|Tree Grab}} until Tiny loses the {{M|tree}}.
** Procs all {{M|on-cast effects}}.

* Has the following targeting functionalities, which modifies the {{M|projectile}} traveling properties:
** Has {{#var:Tree Throw basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.
** {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** When unit-targeted, the projectile homes in on the unit-targeted enemy until projectile impact or upon being {{M|disjointed}}.
*** Does not grant {{M|vision}}.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
**** Applies all ability effects upon projectile impact.
*** Cannot be cast on the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers}}
** {{Symbol|Target|Point}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Tiny Tree Throw Vision Visualized icon.png|320px]]
*** When point-targeted, the projectile travels in a straight line accordingly to the point-targeted direction, up to its max travel distance, from point [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] to point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*** The projectile stops traveling upon hitting an enemy unit, and then applies all projectile impact effects.
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#var:Tree Throw value1}}}}
**** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
***** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
****** Grants a non-lingering 200-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the projectile while traveling, highlighted in red per the diagram above.
***** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
****** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Tree Throw value1}}+{{#var:Tree Throw value2}}}}-distance away with the travel distance and collision radius.
****** Hits {{M|attack immune}} units, but does nothing to them.
****** Applies all ability effects on the first enemy unit hit while traveling. Affects the following primary and secondary units:
******* {{M|Debuff immune}} units.
******* {{M|Invisible}} units.
******* {{M|Untargetable}} units.
****** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
******* Grants a 2-second 200-radius flying vision upon projectile impact.

* {{Symbol|Trees}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** The [[tree]] projectile {{M|instant attack}} component utilizes the caster's {{M|attack range}}-type upon launched.
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** The attack is considered a {{M|melee}} attack sourced from Tiny despite the projectile's visual effects.
**** Hence, {{M|items}} that use different values for the wielder's attack range-type applies its melee ability effects upon projectile impact.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*** Has two main [[projectile]] impact properties:
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]]
***** The ability effects are applied as follows on the primary {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy {{Code|P}}, or the first enemy {{Code|P}} upon [[projectile]] impact:
*****# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tiny_tosstree_slow}}
*****# Applies an [[instant attack]] with the following properties:
*****#* Procs any {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal.
*****#* Have {{M|True Strike}}.
*****#* Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
**** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Splash}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|Area-Dummy|size=56px}}
***** The ability effects are applied as follows on secondary enemy units within {{#var:Tree Throw value3}}-radius of the primary instant attacked enemy {{Code|P}}:
*****# The {{M|splash}} {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}}, is defined as:
*****#* {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SplashDmg {{=}} Σ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] + {{#var:Tree Throw value5}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Tiny|v3r}}|tal|x}} + {{ValueColor||{{#var:Tree Throw basic1}}|shd|x}}}}
*****#** Affected by {{M|damage block}} sources on the enemy individually within the area-of-effect.
*****#** {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}} Has the following damage flags:
*****#*** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
*****#*** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
*****#** Stack and work independently with other {{M|cleave}} sources.
*****#** Affects the following units:
*****#*** {{M|Couriers}}

