***** {{Symbol|Channeling|f}}
****** If there are no valid trees upon the interval check, the channeling ends immediately.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
**** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
***** Grants a non-lingering 200-radius [[flying vision]] centered around the projectile while traveling.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
**** The ability effects are applied as follows upon [[projectile]] impact:
****# {{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|tiny_toss_land_debuff}}
