****#* Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
**** Affects the following units:
***** {{M|Couriers}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Tree Volley icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Tiny channels to throw random trees within range towards the targeted area. Deals Tiny's attack with Tree Throw bonuses.
}}
* This ability is a standalone ability.
** Does not require {{A|Tiny|Tree Grab}} to be learned to unlock.
** Does not rely on {{A|Tiny|Tree Throw}} values to work.

